rols, no login or API key. Choose a faction and start. Saves and JSON import/export are local to the current browser.",[897],{"_56":898,"_26":885,"_202":-7},"阅读作者的开发贡献记录",[900,901,902,903],"Choose a faction and inspect a city and its officers.","Read the creation record and portrait provenance.","Execute an economic order and follow its resource and officer effects.","Change one economy or combat rule and test turns, opponents and saves.","MartinDelophy 提出策略游戏方向，要求扩充武将、头像和数值平衡。Codex 中的 GPT-6 Astra 多轮实现规则、界面、数据、对手、存档和测试；地形与头像图集由独立图像工具生成。","DOM/CSS + SVG · React",[900,901,902,903],{"_56":914,"_26":885,"_18":327},{"_56":913,"_26":894,"_18":212,"_202":895},{"_56":469,"_26":889,"_255":256,"_202":890},{"_56":912,"_26":885,"_202":886},[124],"Read the explicit Astra-in-Codex attribution","Play Three Kingdoms","Read the creator’s contribution record","example:eight-second-crew-codex","eight-second-crew-codex","8 秒盗贼团","录制一段八秒行动，让分身在下一轮重播，与过去的自己合作偷取钥匙并逃脱。九个关卡逐步加入机关踏板、巡逻者和投射物。","/zh/examples/eight-second-crew-codex/",{"_20":916,"_22":917,"_24":918,"_114":974,"_96":245,"_241":246,"_238":971,"_9":975,"_223":976,"_19":977,"_33":978,"_198":979,"_189":980,"_459":981},[923,924,925,926,927,928,929,930,931,932,933,934,935,936,937,938,939,940,941,942],"8-Second Crew · 8초 도둑단",{"_54":22,"_58":917,"_60":22,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":118,"_58":918,"_60":24,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":243,"_58":974,"_60":114,"_62":63,"_64":65},{"_54":181,"_56":456,"_230":457,"_68":972,"_60":459,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":94,"_58":242,"_60":96,"_62":97,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":239,"_58":240,"_60":241,"_62":93,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":236,"_58":971,"_60":238,"_62":63,"_64":36},{"_54":181,"_56":229,"_230":231,"_68":966,"_60":9,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":224,"_68":963,"_60":223,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":221,"_58":310,"_60":223,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":219,"_58":220,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":66,"_56":213,"_68":959,"_60":19,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":211,"_58":212,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":206,"_68":955,"_60":33,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":204,"_58":205,"_60":33,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":196,"_68":950,"_60":198,"_62":-7},{"_54":66,"_56":187,"_68":948,"_60":189,"_62":-7},{"_54":181,"_60":182,"_56":183,"_68":947,"_64":65},{"_54":171,"_60":122,"_56":943,"_79":944,"_89":945,"_33":946,"_176":177,"_178":179,"_61":289},{"_54":55,"_60":168,"_56":169,"_58":665,"_64":65},"The author-hosted game after recording the first clone.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/eight-second-crew-codex.webp","A duck thief and its recorded clone in the opening museum, with key, guard sight cone and eight-second HUD.","https://sdj3261.github.io/openai_game_2026/",[185],[949],{"_56":102,"_26":103},[951],{"_56":952,"_26":953,"_202":954},"查看人工与 Codex 的开发分工","https://github.com/sdj3261/openai_game_2026#codex와-함께-만든-과정","README and the creator’s linked article describe concrete planning, implementation, sprite, QA and deployment work; neither is a complete session transcript.",[956],{"_56":440,"_26":957,"_202":958},"https://github.com/sdj3261/openai_game_2026","Complete static project with modules, nine stages, sprites, fonts, tests and demo recording. Node.js 18+; npm start, with no dependency installation. Code has no explicit license; the bundled Galmuri font uses OFL.",[960],{"_56":961,"_26":946,"_202":962},"试玩 8-Second Crew","Korean, English and Japanese; keyboard, click-to-move and touch. WASD/arrows move, X records a clone, Z lures guards, and R restarts. Wait through the brief Ready countdown before moving.",[964],{"_56":965,"_26":953,"_202":-7},"阅读作者的 Codex 开发记录",[967,968,969,970],"Start the first stage and learn movement, keys and exits.","Read the creator’s Codex development account and asset credits.","Press X to record a route, then inspect how the clone replays it.","Change a stage or replay rule and test a complete escape and restart.","DongJae Shin 决定规则、难度和表现方向，Codex 协助规划与实现关卡、碰撞、行动重播、界面、测试和部署。Agent Sprite Forge 处理生成角色的精灵素材，作者反复试玩并提出修改。",[973],"Agent Sprite Forge","Canvas 2D · Vanilla JavaScript · HTML/CSS UI",[967,968,969,970],{"_56":984,"_26":953,"_18":327},{"_56":983,"_26":946,"_18":212,"_202":962},{"_56":469,"_26":957,"_255":256,"_202":958},{"_56":982,"_26":953,"_202":954},[124],[973],"Read the author’s human and Codex division of work","Play 8-Second Crew","Read the creator’s Codex build account","example:word-rain-chatgpt","word-rain-chatgpt","Word Rain","移动篮子，按顺序接住字母拼成单词，同时躲避红色危险方块。护盾、万能字母、完美单词连击和变化的下落速度，让拼字街机不断增加挑战。","/zh/examples/word-rain-chatgpt/",{"_20":986,"_22":987,"_24":988,"_114":1054,"_96":245,"_241":246,"_238":1053,"_9":1048,"_223":1055,"_19":1056,"_33":1057,"_198":1058,"_189":1059,"_592":1060},[992,993,994,995,996,997,998,999,1000,1001,1002,1003,1004,1005,1006,1007,1008,1009,1010,1011],{"_54":22,"_58":987,"_60":22,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":118,"_58":988,"_60":24,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":243,"_58":1054,"_60":114,"_62":63,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":94,"_58":242,"_60":96,"_62":97,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":239,"_58":240,"_60":241,"_62":93,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":236,"_58":1053,"_60":238,"_62":63,"_64":36},{"_54":181,"_56":229,"_230":231,"_68":1048,"_60":9,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":66,"_56":224,"_68":1044,"_60":223,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":221,"_58":1043,"_60":223,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":219,"_58":1042,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":213,"_68":1038,"_60":19,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":211,"_58":212,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":590,"_68":1030,"_60":592,"_62":-7},{"_54":66,"_56":206,"_68":1025,"_60":33,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":204,"_58":205,"_60":33,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":196,"_68":1020,"_60":198,"_62":-7},{"_54":66,"_56":187,"_68":1018,"_60":189,"_62":-7},{"_54":181,"_60":182,"_56":183,"_68":1016,"_64":65},{"_54":171,"_60":122,"_56":1012,"_79":1013,"_89":1014,"_33":1015,"_176":177,"_178":179,"_61":289},{"_54":55,"_60":168,"_56":169,"_58":665,"_64":65},"The running author-hosted game after start and ordinary direction-key basket movement.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/word-rain-chatgpt.webp","Word Rain in play, with falling letter tiles, a basket, target word, score, hearts, shield and speed indicators.","https://octopuskid.github.io/word-rain/",[1017,185],"ChatGPT",[1019],{"_56":102,"_26":103},[1021],{"_56":1022,"_26":1023,"_202":1024},"Read the author’s ChatGPT/Codex disclosure","https://octopuskid.itch.io/word-rain","The author explicitly credits ChatGPT/Codex for code and interface text, retaining design and refinement. The repository also links a behind-the-scenes development video. No exact model version is specified.",[1026],{"_56":1027,"_26":1028,"_202":1029},"Open the complete browser and Android project","https://github.com/octopuskid/word-rain","Complete index.html, game handwriting font, bundled recordings and audio credits, plus Android Java/WebView source and packaging scripts. Open the HTML with assets/music intact; the original generated tune works without those two recordings. Code, original font, tune and synthesized effects are MIT; Kevin MacLeod recordings are CC BY 4.0. See android/README.md for Android builds.",[1031,1032],{"_56":1036,"_26":1015,"_202":1037},{"_56":1033,"_26":1034,"_202":1035},"GitHub Releases","https://github.com/octopuskid/word-rain/releases/tag/v1.5.3","Download — Version 1.5.3, published 19 October 2026: Full/Lite Android APKs, self-contained Lite HTML/ZIP and the complete offline browser ZIP. Android requires 8.0+. Release page and Lite APK/ZIP HTTP endpoints returned 200; installation was not tested.","GitHub Pages","Browser play — Alternative author-hosted browser edition; normal start, moving letters and direction-key basket controls were checked.",[1039],{"_56":1040,"_26":1023,"_202":1041},"Play Word Rain on itch.io","Free browser game with keyboard, drag and touch controls; an alternative browser build is linked on GitHub Pages. The store and GitHub Releases also offer Full/Lite Android APKs and an offline Lite HTML ZIP. Android requires 8.0+. Browser start, moving letters and basket controls were checked; APK installation and a complete scoring run were not tested.","itch.io","quickstart",[1045],{"_56":1046,"_26":1047,"_202":-7},"Read the creator’s source and run guide","https://github.com/octopuskid/word-rain#run-the-game",[1049,1050,1051,1052],"启动网页游戏，用方向键、A/D 或拖动操作篮子。","阅读作者的 AI 披露，对比浏览器和 Android 版本。","保留 assets/music 目录打开 index.html，或下载独立 Lite 版本在离线浏览器运行。","在 Canvas 游戏中跟踪字母生成、接取、护盾和计分逻辑，修改规则前检查暂停与继续。","octopuskid 负责设计和打磨，ChatGPT/Codex 辅助代码及界面文本。原创旋律与音效通过代码合成，也有 ChatGPT 协助；两首可选 Kevin MacLeod 录音单独署名，并非 AI 生成音乐。","Canvas 2D · JavaScript · DOM/CSS UI",{"_56":1046,"_26":1047,"_18":1043},{"_56":1040,"_26":1023,"_18":212,"_202":1041},{"_56":1027,"_26":1028,"_255":256,"_202":1029},{"_56":1022,"_26":1023,"_202":1024},[124],[1061,1062],{"_623":1036,"_26":1015,"_18":212,"_202":1064},{"_623":1033,"_26":1034,"_18":514,"_202":1063},"Version 1.5.3, published 19 October 2026: Full/Lite Android APKs, self-contained Lite HTML/ZIP and the complete offline browser ZIP. Android requires 8.0+. Release page and Lite APK/ZIP HTTP endpoints returned 200; installation was not tested.","Alternative author-hosted browser edition; normal start, moving letters and direction-key basket controls were checked.","example:overexposed-ai","overexposed-ai","Overexposed","通过卡牌选择，引导一位初露头角的艺人度过一年的职业生涯。平衡技艺、金钱和关注度，观察三家报纸的反应，避免过高热度引发丑闻。","/zh/examples/overexposed-ai/",{"_20":1066,"_22":1067,"_24":1068,"_114":1129,"_96":245,"_241":246,"_238":1126,"_9":1121,"_223":1130,"_19":1131,"_33":1132,"_198":1133,"_189":1134,"_459":1135},[1072,1073,1074,1075,1076,1077,1078,1079,1080,1081,1082,1083,1084,1085,1086,1087,1088,1089,1090,1091,1092],{"_54":22,"_58":1067,"_60":22,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":118,"_58":1068,"_60":24,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":243,"_58":1129,"_60":114,"_62":63,"_64":65},{"_54":181,"_56":456,"_230":457,"_68":1127,"_60":459,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":94,"_58":242,"_60":96,"_62":97,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":239,"_58":240,"_60":241,"_62":93,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":236,"_58":1126,"_60":238,"_62":63,"_64":36},{"_54":181,"_56":229,"_230":231,"_68":1121,"_60":9,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":66,"_56":224,"_68":1117,"_60":223,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":221,"_58":1043,"_60":223,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":55,"_56":219,"_58":1042,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":213,"_68":1113,"_60":19,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":211,"_58":212,"_60":19,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":206,"_68":1108,"_60":33,"_62":-7},{"_54":55,"_56":204,"_58":205,"_60":33,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_56":196,"_68":1104,"_60":198,"_62":-7},{"_54":66,"_56":187,"_68":1101,"_60":189,"_62":-7},{"_54":181,"_60":182,"_56":183,"_68":1100,"_64":65},{"_54":171,"_60":122,"_56":1096,"_79":1097,"_89":1098,"_33":1099,"_176":177,"_178":179,"_61":670},{"_54":55,"_60":663,"_56":664,"_58":665,"_64":65},{"_54":66,"_60":658,"_56":659,"_68":1093},[1094],{"_56":659,"_26":1095},"https://img.itch.zone/aW1hZ2UvNTA3MzQwMi8zMTAxNTIwOS5wbmc=/original/pgaZBa.png","Creator-published gameplay screenshot from the itch.io game page.","/GameMap/assets/media/learning/overexposed-ai.webp","Overexposed’s desktop card table with newspapers, career cards, money, fame, craft, heat and an End Turn control.","https://eg30.itch.io/overexposed",[186,185],[1102,1103],{"_56":186,"_26":195},{"_56":102,"_26":103},[1105],{"_56":1106,"_26":1099,"_202":1107},"Read the creator’s AI contribution and asset disclosure","The author names Claude Code and OpenAI Codex and explains human editing of text. README confirms AI-assisted commits with Co-Authored-By trailers; CREDITS.md explains procedural pictures/effects and the separate music/font sources.",[1109],{"_56":1110,"_26":1111,"_202":1112},"Open the complete career-simulation project","https://github.com/zsh56609/overexposed","Complete TypeScript/React project with the rule engine, content, UI drawings, procedural sound, six music files, fonts, balance simulator and browser checks. Node.js >=22.18; npm install, npm run dev or npm run build. No explicit software license is provided, so public source availability does not establish reuse rights. Bundled fonts are OFL 1.1 and Holizna music is CC0; see CREDITS.md.",[1114],{"_56":1115,"_26":1099,"_202":1116},"Play Overexposed on itch.io","Browser playtest build, best on a landscape desktop screen. Uses mouse or touch; cards show effects on hover or long press. Begin, opening text and manager choice reached the live card desk in Chrome. The complete year, all endings and touch play were not tested; the hosted build is not claimed to match the latest repository revision.",[1118],{"_56":1119,"_26":1120,"_202":-7},"Read the game’s source and local run commands","https://github.com/zsh56609/overexposed#readme",[1122,1123,1124,1125],"打开 itch.io 网页版本，依次选择 Begin、Continue 并签约经纪人。","选择开局卡牌，观察桌面、资源和报纸如何回应。","阅读作者 AI 披露、README 和 CREDITS.md，区分程序化美术、音效与第三方音乐。","使用 Node.js 22.18+ 执行 npm install、npm run dev，沿 content/cards.json、core/reducer.ts 和 React 桌面阅读规则，再测试一整年。","EG30 负责设计、方向和写作，使用 Claude Code 与 OpenAI Codex 实现游戏，并亲自修改 AI 辅助起草的文本。美术和音效通过代码绘制或合成；Holizna 背景音乐另有 CC0 署名。",[1128],"Canvas 2D (procedural halftone art)","DOM/CSS + SVG · React UI",{"_56":1119,"_26":1120,"_18":1043},{"_56":1115,"_26":1099,"_18":212,"_202":1116},{"_56":1110,"_26":1111,"_255":256,"_202":1112},{"_56":1106,"_26":1099,"_202":1107},[253,124],[1128],"resource:codex","resource","在本地仓库中阅读与修改文件、执行命令、审查代码的通用编程代理。","/zh/resources/",{"_20":124,"_1202":102,"_241":1203,"_54":1204,"_1201":1138,"_1196":1195,"_26":1193,"_66":1205,"_1180":1206,"_1173":1207,"_1169":1208,"_1166":284},[1143,1144,1145,1146,1147,1148,1149,1150,1151,1152,1153,1154,1155],"website/src/data/resources.json",{"_54":22,"_58":102,"_60":1202,"_62":-7,"_64":65},{"_54":118,"_58":1138,"_60":1201,"_62":-7,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":1199,"_58":1200,"_60":241,"_62":97,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":1197,"_58":1198,"_60":54,"_62":97,"_64":36},{"_54":55,"_56":1194,"_58":1195,"_60":1196,"_62":63,"_64":36},{"_54":66,